 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Tensor product of Weil complexes",
 "statement": "The construction of [def-wf-tensor-product] restricts to an exact\nbifunctor\n\n$$\n-\\otimes^L_E-:\\mathrm{WeilD}(X_0,E)\\times\\mathrm{WeilD}(X_0,E)\n\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{WeilD}(X_0,E).\n$$",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-algebraic-groups-lie-algebras/sk-p-cyclotomic/lem-wf-tensor-weil.md",
  "place": "node lem-wf-tensor-weil, order 2569"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "def-wf-tensor-product",
  "def-wf-weil-category"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "For Weil complexes $(K,\\varphi_K)$, $(L,\\varphi_L)$, the arrow\n$\\varphi_K\\otimes\\varphi_L$ is the tensor of the two Frobenius\nisomorphisms, hence an isomorphism satisfying the Weil-cocycle\ncondition by the functoriality of the construction of\n[def-wf-tensor-product]; the bifunctoriality is that of the\nambient derived tensor.",
   "uses": [
    "def-wf-tensor-product"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
